    "Livery catalogue (#118, #21): every livery design per boat class, the safe palette and the rule each swatch passes. Schema: LiveryCatalogue.swift.",
    "Swatches and rule are docs/palette.md's (#53): reserved hues vermillion, orange, yellow and chevron blue at 20 degrees of OKLCH hue (chroma below 0.06 exempt), OKLab distance 0.15 from the chevron's blue, and OKLCH lightness 0.20 from water, puff and lull, charcoal excepted (read by the hull outline, #29). #169 revises the values as a new version.",
    "Skiff: 4 free starter designs, 3 earned at 10, 50 and 200 completed online races (#21 'for example': placeholders awaiting tuning), and 12 paid, 4 at each tier ($0.99, $1.99, $2.99). ILCA dinghy: the 4 free starters only. Pattern and sail-graphic names are the renderer's (#119), placeholders until the designs are drawn (#22)."
